Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.30,0:00:22.42,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnTimesNewRoman\shad0\fs36\3c&HFBFFFE&\an7\frz8.498\clip(269,73,271,114)\pos(282,71)\fad(1,187)\clip(267,73,276,116)\t(6,1007,1,\clip(275,58,417,107)\c&H121A2E&}All Away
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.53,0:01:36.49,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(481,478)\fs13\shad2\c&H222C04&\3c&HEEDCCF&\blur0\bord1\shad0\fnTimes New Roman\4c&HC7CD96&\pos(123,63)}Episode{\c&H8065C7&} 8 {\c&H8A80CC&}{\c&H020201}   That Was Too {\c&HA49F43&}Impressive
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.37,0:01:37.74,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\shad0\fs28\an8\fnArial\b1\c&H82732B&\3c&HE2F3F4&\pos(330,20)}Grand Bath
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.76,0:01:49.71,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,The rush of online orders suddenly \Ndied down after about a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.03,0:01:53.76,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,I wonder if it was just \Nsome kind of passing fad.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.47,0:02:02.10,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,It's so cold! And sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.83,0:02:05.98,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,And the lounge is so roomy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.55,0:02:09.97,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,It is nice to get out and try \Na different public bath sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.00,0:02:16.24,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry for being so late.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.70,0:02:17.56,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.24,0:02:22.52,Default,Staff 1,0,0,0,,Look, I told you we needed to go \Nscouting first thing in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.52,0:02:26.13,Default,Staff 1,0,0,0,,We gotta be in Shikoku \Nby tomorrow morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.13,0:02:32.40,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,Th-That was my mistake. \NI am truly sorry about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.65,0:02:39.22,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,They will be closing soon, though, \Nso please wait just a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.22,0:02:42.94,Default,Staff 1,0,0,0,,The city's last coordinator \Nwas a lot more reliable.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.94,0:02:45.39,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,I am so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.90,0:02:53.36,Default,Staff 2,0,0,0,,Do you think we have enough time?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.36,0:02:55.51,Default,Staff 1,0,0,0,,Well, we'll have to make it work.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.49,0:02:56.56,Default,Customer,0,0,0,,The water was perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.56,0:02:58.16,Default,Manager,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.17,0:03:04.52,Default,Staff 1,0,0,0,,Hey! You spilled it on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.91,0:03:10.00,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry! \NI, uh, wasn't paying attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.00,0:03:12.42,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,I'll wipe it off immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.42,0:03:15.67,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Um, that would be a bad idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.67,0:03:16.58,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.58,0:03:19.26,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I'll get something for it. \NPlease wait a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.89,0:03:21.93,Default,Staff 1,0,0,0,,Who was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.43,0:03:27.52,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,If you spill coffee, don't panic.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.52,0:03:31.82,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Wet a tissue with soap and water \Nand after you have soaked the stain,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.44,0:03:36.20,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,hold a towel or handkerchief \Nunder the stain
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.20,0:03:41.82,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,and push down from the top with another \Ndry tissue to squeeze out the moisture.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.82,0:03:43.58,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,It should come right out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.58,0:03:49.70,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,If you panic and start rubbing it, \Nit will stain, so please be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.09,0:03:52.75,Default,Staff 1,0,0,0,,O-Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.71,0:03:57.47,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,There. Your shirt should be fine now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.47,0:03:59.09,Default,Staff 1,0,0,0,,Th-Thanks a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.09,0:04:02.35,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,Ah... um...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.74,0:04:07.98,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I run a cleaning business nearby. \NMy name is Kinme.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.26,0:04:10.48,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I'm used to dealing with things like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.30,0:04:16.24,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,Th-Th-That was too impressive!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.59,0:04:21.07,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,I... I would love to learn \Nhow to be that resourceful.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.07,0:04:23.37,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Uh, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.98,0:04:27.92,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,I forgot to introduce myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.92,0:04:33.87,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,I work at city hall \Nin the Tourism Economy Division.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.87,0:04:35.88,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,My name is Hatsuayu Uka.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.88,0:04:41.39,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\p1\bord0\an8\shad0\c&HF1F1F3&\frz6.079\pos(394.5,74)\fscx121\fscy78\clip(m 458 233 l 466 228 474 227 487 229 497 233 548 225 530 62 264 83 279 251)}m 0 0 l 230 0 l 230 215 l 0 215
Dialogue: 1,0:04:38.88,0:04:41.39,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an9\shad0\fnVerdana\b1\frz5.172\c&H6D6B70&\3c&HF1F2F4&\pos(457,76)}Atami City Hall
Dialogue: 1,0:04:38.88,0:04:41.39,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an7\shad0\fnTimes New Roman\frz5.172\c&H6D6B70&\3c&HF1F2F4&\fs16\pos(272,128)}Tourism Economy Division,\NTourism and Construction Department\NOffice for the Promotion of Tourism
Dialogue: 1,0:04:38.88,0:04:41.39,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an9\shad0\fnVerdana\b1\frz5.172\c&H6D6B70&\3c&HF1F2F4&\fs14\pos(516,162)}Location Coordination and Assistance
Dialogue: 1,0:04:38.88,0:04:41.39,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an9\shad0\fnVerdana\b1\frz5.172\c&H6D6B70&\3c&HF1F2F4&\fs30\pos(498,186)}Hatsuayu Uka
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.88,0:04:41.39,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\p1\bord0\an8\shad0\c&HE9EDEF&\frz6.079\fscx122\fscy23\pos(288.5,260)\clip(m 175 274 l 173 284 171 294 167 304 164 310 161 315 389 294 382 266 380 257)}m 0 0 l 230 0 l 230 215 l 0 215
Dialogue: 1,0:04:38.88,0:04:41.39,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an7\shad0\fnTimes New Roman\frz5.172\c&H6D6B70&\3c&HF1F2F4&\fs16\pos(179,288)}1-1 Chuo-cho, Atami, Shizuoka
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.88,0:04:40.46,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,A location coordinator?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.46,0:04:41.39,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.66,0:04:46.27,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,I provide information about \Nlocation facilities for TV and movies
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.27,0:04:48.80,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,and help coordinate shoots.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.14,0:04:53.40,Default,Staff 1,0,0,0,,The guy said we can go in now, \Nso we're gonna get started.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.40,0:04:54.56,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,Ah, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.11,0:04:59.56,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,Thank you very much. Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.31,0:05:06.71,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,Working this late? It must be a tough job.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.04,0:05:10.54,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an9\b1\fs19\c&H717680&\3c&H3F4D6D&\shad0\fax0.26\frz346\pos(538,28)\fad(1,940)}Nikko-tei
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.04,0:05:10.54,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\shad0\fs28\an8\fnArial\b1\c&H82732B&\3c&HE2F3F4&\fad(1,940)}Grand Bath
Dialogue: 1,0:05:09.58,0:05:13.04,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\b1\fnArial\fad(980,1)\shad0\c&H9FD4E5&\3c&H988572&}Kinme Cleaning
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.34,0:05:17.08,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Yes. I believe I can \Nwork with this material.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.08,0:05:20.61,Default,Regular,0,0,0,,You can? Thank goodness! \NThen I'll leave it in your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.61,0:05:21.78,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.78,0:05:23.52,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,You can count on Kinme.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.52,0:05:25.72,Default,Regular,0,0,0,,You always do come through.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.96,0:05:55.46,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an7\b1\c&HE6DDDC&\3c&H9A501C&\shad0\fax0.26\fs30\frz350.7\pos(65,152)}Gift Shop\N{\an7\b1\c&HE6DDDC&\3c&H9A501C&\shad0\fax0.26\b1\3c&H9A501C&\fs24\shad0\pos(116,190)}\hAtsuei Dried Fish Shop
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.46,0:06:01.97,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs16\b1\shad0\c&H464039&\3c&HA0A19C&\pos(14,16)\frz355.5}Atsuei Dried Fish Company Direct Sales
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.46,0:06:01.97,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs14\b1\shad0\c&H464039&\3c&HA0A19C&\pos(452,54)\frz356.1}Atsuei Gift and Souvenir Shop
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.78,0:05:59.70,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh, that reminds me. \NI decided to try that other bath house.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.70,0:06:01.97,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,It's a little far, but it is really nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.97,0:06:06.47,Default,Nairo's Grandma,0,0,0,,Is it? Perhaps I'll take \NNairo-chan there sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.47,0:06:11.05,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Definitely! Well, I should get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.63,0:06:18.86,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.86,0:06:22.86,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Is there anything I can \Nhelp you with today, Hatsuayu-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.86,0:06:24.56,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.23,0:06:27.37,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,Tha...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.09,0:06:33.37,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.81,0:06:43.88,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I just really wanted to see \Nhow you work with customers up close.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.30,0:06:51.39,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,I've always been super bad at \Ncommunicating with people and stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.80,0:07:02.90,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,I got a job at city hall thinking \NI could do office work behind the scenes,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.90,0:07:14.91,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\p1\bord0\an8\shad0\c&HF9FBFA&\frz359.8\fad(2441,1)\fscx227\fscy166\pos(318.5,5)}m 0 0 l 230 0 l 240 215 l 0 215
Dialogue: 1,0:07:02.90,0:07:14.91,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an9\shad0\fnVerdana\b1\c&H6D6B70&\3c&HF9FBFA&\fad(2441,1)\fs44\pos(466,30)}Atami City Hall
Dialogue: 1,0:07:02.90,0:07:14.91,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an7\shad0\fnTimes New Roman\c&H6D6B70&\3c&HF9FBFA&\fs36\fad(2441,1)\pos(92,85)}Tourism Economy Division,\NTourism and Construction Department\NOffice for the Promotion of Tourism
Dialogue: 1,0:07:02.90,0:07:14.91,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an9\shad0\fnVerdana\b1\c&H6D6B70&\3c&HF9FBFA&\fs34\fad(2441,1)\pos(614,201)}Location Coordination and Assistance
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.90,0:07:14.91,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an9\shad0\fnVerdana\b1\c&H6D6B70&\3c&HF9FBFA&\fs60\fad(2441,1)\pos(500,229)}Hatsuayu Uka
Dialogue: 1,0:07:03.18,0:07:08.64,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,but then I got assigned to the Tourism \NEconomy Division as location coordinator.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:08.64,0:07:14.91,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,It's a job for someone who is resourceful \Nand has excellent communication skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.50,0:07:17.90,Flashback,Voice 1,0,0,0,,Get permission \Nfrom the hotel for that shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.90,0:07:19.42,Flashback,Voice 2,0,0,0,,Can you handle the lunches for the crew?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.42,0:07:23.63,Flashback,Voice 3,0,0,0,,I'd like to change \Nthe actor's accommodations.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.63,0:07:25.64,Flashback,Voice 4,0,0,0,,Please get us clearance to use that road.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.64,0:07:27.93,Flashback,Voice 5,0,0,0,,Don't you know of a good hole-in-the-wall?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.93,0:07:29.98,Flashback,Voice 6,0,0,0,,We're looking for a restaurant \Nfor our cooking show.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.98,0:07:32.45,Flashback,Voice 7,0,0,0,,How can I get in touch with local extras?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.18,0:07:37.45,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,So I'm always s-stressed out\N about all that,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.45,0:07:42.94,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,but when I saw you jump into action \Nwith such great social skills...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.33,0:07:46.50,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,B-Basically, I wanted to ask you,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.50,0:07:51.20,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,what's the trick to being good at \Na job that depends on client relations?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.07,0:07:55.34,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,What's the trick? Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.71,0:08:00.07,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.89,0:08:05.71,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,If it's okay with you, why not \Njoin me at the public bath tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.03,0:08:06.81,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.97,0:08:10.59,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\p1\bord0\an8\shad0\c&H71888F&\fscx60\fscy8\frz352.4\pos(126.5,19)}m 0 0 l 230 0 l 230 215 l 0 215
