Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.97,0:08:10.59,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\b1\shad0\fs26\frx2\fry12\c&H839BA2&\3c&H4B6771&\pos(35,233)\frz90.25}Hot Spring Bath
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.97,0:08:10.59,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\b1\shad0\fs17\frx2\fry12\c&H3E95BA&\3c&HAED7E1&\frz90.25\pos(316,85)}Atami Station Front
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.97,0:08:10.59,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\shad0\pos(565,15)\c&H2D4CD0&\3c&HA9E9EA&}Station Front\NHot Spring
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.78,0:08:10.59,Default,Regular 2,0,0,0,,Okay, Kinme-san. Catch you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.59,0:08:13.26,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh! Have a good night!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.65,0:08:15.64,Default,Regular 3,0,0,0,,Good evening, Kinme-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.64,0:08:19.06,Default,Regular 3,0,0,0,,Today sure was a hot one! \NI feel completely drained.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.06,0:08:23.61,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Good evening. \NYes, I was sweating all day long.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.61,0:08:28.18,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,D-Do you come \Nto the public bath often, Kinme-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.18,0:08:31.36,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Yes, I do. Basically every night.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.36,0:08:35.39,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,My usual spots are this station-front\N bath and one other place
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.39,0:08:37.50,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,called the Yamada Baths.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.68,0:08:44.54,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,I don't think I've been to \Na public bath since kindergarten...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.98,0:08:48.26,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,unless you count taking \Nvisitors to shooting locations.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.55,0:08:53.82,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,If you get used to visiting public baths, \Nyou start to recognize the people you meet
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.82,0:08:56.27,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,and get used to greeting\N and talking to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.53,0:08:59.00,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.39,0:09:02.65,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs22\shad0\c&HDCD3D5&\3c&HA98586&\bord2}This is {\c&H461D8A&}hot spring water\N{\c&HDCD3D5&}straight from the source.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.39,0:09:02.65,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an9\fs22\shad0\c&H8169C0&\3c&HDED4D2&\bord2}Please do not shut off\N{\c&HA98586&}the water completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.90,0:09:02.65,Default,Housewife 1,0,0,0,,Look, I found another gray hair!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.65,0:09:04.72,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,Mama, you worry about it too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.72,0:09:06.40,Default,Housewife 2,0,0,0,,She sure does.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.40,0:09:10.49,Default,Housewife 1,0,0,0,,Oh, did you hear? Yut-chan \Nis pregnant with her second child!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.49,0:09:11.60,Default,Housewife 2,0,0,0,,She is?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.60,0:09:14.16,Default,Housewife 1,0,0,0,,Yes! And when I took \Nmy girl to go see them...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.42,0:09:20.60,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,Th-There's a lot of people here \Nand I can hear them all talking,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.60,0:09:24.76,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,but for some reason, \NI actually find it kind of relaxing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.17,0:09:27.67,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,You do? I'm glad you like it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.29,0:09:33.76,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,You know, I don't really think \Nthere's a trick to doing my job.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.76,0:09:34.68,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.15,0:09:41.13,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Of course you do need some \Nknowledge and skills to clean well,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.13,0:09:42.67,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,but I don't know,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.34,0:09:49.08,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I think I do this work because I enjoy \Nseeing my customers satisfied.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.83,0:09:56.07,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,On top of that, I really like \Nthis town and the people here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.07,0:09:58.08,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I think that's a big part of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.08,0:10:05.35,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,You like the town... \Nyou want people to be satisfied...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.07,0:10:09.90,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,It's a little hard to put into words,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.90,0:10:14.09,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,but I think that's \Nwhat this work means to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.38,0:10:17.03,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,Now I un...derstand.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.97,0:10:19.72,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,You're gonna pass out from the heat!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.97,0:10:29.11,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\b1\shad0\fs20\frx2\fry12\c&H2C94C5&\3c&HAED7E1&\frz90.25\move(329,106,329,130,22,11116)}Atami Station Front
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.97,0:10:29.11,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\shad0\c&H2D4CD0&\3c&HA9E9EA&\move(476,7,476,26,22,11116)}Station Front\NHot Spring
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.72,0:10:23.52,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,B-But it was very educational.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.52,0:10:24.79,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,N-No, wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.79,0:10:27.79,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Hatsuayu-san! \NLet's get you out of the bath!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.87,0:10:36.71,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,That was nice to see yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.90,0:10:43.18,Flashback,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,I-I'll start going \Nto the public bath every day
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.18,0:10:45.10,Flashback,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,{\t(1589,2298,\1c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&)}to develop my social skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.39,0:10:48.35,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,I'm rooting for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.42,0:10:56.93,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Wow! Are they shooting something?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.22,0:10:58.92,Default,Director,0,0,0,,Okay, we're good!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.42,0:11:04.37,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,Very glad to be of help.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.69,0:11:11.65,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I'll catch you at the bath, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.95,0:11:22.95,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\shad0\fs22\c&HC4C480&\3c&HFBFFFE&\an7\frz9.132\pos(78,25)}Wash {\c&0000000&}It All Away
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.95,0:11:27.96,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\shad0\fs22\c&HC4C480&\3c&HFBFFFE&\an7\frz9.132\pos(90,254)}Wash {\c&0000000&}It All Away
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.47,0:11:46.98,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Wow, I've never seen \Nthis view of the city before.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.02,0:11:55.49,Flashback,Kinme,0,0,0,,Hello, this is Kinme Cleaning.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.49,0:12:02.07,Flashback Italics,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,Kinme-san, w-would you like \Nto model for a photo shoot?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.07,0:12:02.99,Flashback,Kinme,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.99,0:12:07.00,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an7\shad0\fnTimes New Roman\c&H6D6B70&\3c&HFEFFFF&\fs19.5\frz13.65\fax-0.26\pos(96,179)}Tourism Economy Division
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.99,0:12:07.00,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an7\shad0\fnTimes New Roman\c&H6D6B70&\3c&HFEFFFF&\fs12\frz13.65\fax-0.26\pos(316,82)}\h\hOffice for the Promotion of Tourism / Office for Industrial Development\N\hOffice for Media Promotion Strategy\NOffice of Agriculture, Forestry and Fishery / Agriculture Committee
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.99,0:12:07.00,Flashback,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,A local newspaper \Npublishes a free newsletter,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.00,0:12:12.25,Flashback,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,and they're going to do an article on \N"A Relaxing One-Day Girls' Trip."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.25,0:12:17.93,Flashback,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,The newspaper person said they were \Nsearching for local working women
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.93,0:12:20.51,Flashback,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,to be the models on the shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.93,0:12:22.25,Flashback,Kinme,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.25,0:12:28.15,Flashback Italics,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,And well, um, I'm going to be one of them,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.15,0:12:31.00,Flashback Italics,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,but they need one more person.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.00,0:12:32.02,Flashback Italics,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,So I thought maybe I could \Nask you to do it, Kinme-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.02,0:12:35.00,Flashback,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,So I thought maybe I could \Nask you to do it, Kinme-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.32,0:12:38.78,Flashback,Kinme,0,0,0,,Huh? You want me to be the other person?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.03,0:12:45.54,Flashback,Kinme,0,0,0,,I-I don't know the first \Nthing about modeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.54,0:12:50.17,Flashback,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,I know it's a lot to ask, b-but...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.17,0:12:53.18,Flashback Italics,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,they are offering some compensation
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.18,0:12:59.55,Flashback Italics,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,and said they would put ads for \Nyour business in the newsletter for free.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.30,0:13:05.72,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an1\shad0\c&H7E94BB&\3c&HFCFDFD&\b1\t(3066,4318,\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\4c&H000000&}Fall season soon...\N{\c&H84B095&\t(3066,4318,\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\4c&H000000&}Publicity...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.30,0:13:05.72,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an3\shad0\c&HA682AB&\3c&HFCFDFD&\b1\t(3066,4318,\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\4c&H000000&}Ads...\N{\c&H999259&\t(3066,4318,\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\4c&H000000&}Free...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.38,0:13:15.74,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,U-Um, why don't I tell you \Nour plans for the day?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.74,0:13:16.65,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.65,0:13:20.43,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,The photographers \Nwent early to get scenery pictures.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.43,0:13:23.16,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,We'll meet up with them
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.16,0:13:28.66,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,and then take pictures around the island \Nentrance and restaurant district.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.66,0:13:31.71,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,After that, we go to a resort facility
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.71,0:13:35.46,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,and get some shots \Nat the café and the adventure park.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.46,0:13:38.17,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,Then we come back on the last ferry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.50,0:13:41.72,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,That's what we have planned. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.72,0:13:43.21,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,That sounds all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.21,0:13:45.80,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,The island is actually \Nvery close, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.80,0:13:49.36,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,Y-Yes! At only twenty-three minutes away,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.36,0:13:53.27,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,it's famous as the island closest \Nto the Tokyo metropolitan area.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.27,0:13:56.53,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Huh. You really do know your stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.53,0:14:00.19,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,Huh? W-Well, I am from around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.60,0:14:03.45,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,Oh. We'll be arriving soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.45,0:14:14.46,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs22\b1\c&H7CE4F7&\4c&H234250&\3c&H698597&}Welcome to {\fs30}Hatsushima
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.01,0:14:27.47,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs22\b1\c&H7CE4F7&\4c&H234250&\3c&H698597&\fad(395,1)\move(320,17,320,80)}Welcome to {\fs30}Hatsushima
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.75,0:14:36.38,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,Thank you for waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.38,0:14:38.24,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Pleased to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.53,0:14:43.11,Default,Cameraman,0,0,0,,Why don't we go ahead \Nand get a shot of you arriving?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.63,0:14:47.11,Default,Cameraman,0,0,0,,Let's go for a relaxing "girls' day trip" \Nkind of mood today, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.11,0:14:49.66,Default,Cameraman,0,0,0,,Oh, we don't need the helmet, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.83,0:14:52.62,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs22\b1\c&H7CE4F7&\4c&H234250&\3c&H698597&\pos(355,80)}Welcome to {\fs30}Hatsushima
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.95,0:14:56.63,Default,Cameraman,0,0,0,,That's the spirit. Great poses too!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.32,0:15:02.42,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,Huh? Kinme-san, \Nyou seem kind of used to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.42,0:15:07.13,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Um... I've been getting \Nsome practice recently
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.13,0:15:09.22,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,with an elementary school girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.22,0:15:10.14,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.48,0:15:13.38,Default,Editor,0,0,0,,Okay, why don't we head over \Nto the restaurant district next?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.38,0:15:15.70,Default,Editor,0,0,0,,You haven't had lunch yet, have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.70,0:15:16.56,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.15,0:15:20.15,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\b1\shad0\frz355\move(6,75,37,75,0,2977)\fs22\c&H5E4F66&\3c&HC3A3E6&}Dining
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.76,0:15:27.85,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,A-Are you sure we're allowed to eat this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.85,0:15:28.91,Default,Editor,0,0,0,,Absolutely!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.26,0:15:31.66,Default,Editor,0,0,0,,The two of us will eat later on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.66,0:15:36.14,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,It glitters! It's all glittery!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.14,0:15:39.92,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,I'm local, but I never \Nget to eat like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.92,0:15:41.31,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.87,0:15:45.19,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Well, thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.19,0:15:47.51,Default,Cameraman,0,0,0,,Take your time eating, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.94,0:16:04.46,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,Ah! The sashimi is so fresh and firm!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.46,0:16:07.88,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,And when you bite into the mollusks, \Nthey pop with the flavor of the sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.95,0:16:11.67,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,It's so delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.67,0:16:15.04,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,It's been so long \Nsince I've had a proper meal!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.96,0:16:21.07,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,What does Hatsuayu-san usually eat anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.82,0:16:50.03,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I-I have to wear this? You didn't tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.03,0:16:52.84,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry, Kinme-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.84,0:16:56.40,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,I thought you might say no if I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.40,0:16:58.62,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.27,0:17:06.76,Default,Cameraman,0,0,0,,Hey, what a fantastic figure! \NLet's get back to the shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.07,0:17:08.08,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.76,0:17:12.92,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I hope this is all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.33,0:17:42.17,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,And now a bathing scene, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.43,0:17:45.56,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.67,0:17:50.47,Default,Cameraman,0,0,0,,Oh! Just like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.56,0:17:52.95,Italics,Cameraman (M),0,0,0,,What a lovely expression.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.41,0:17:58.18,Default,Cameraman,0,0,0,,That's it! Thank you both.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.38,0:18:01.10,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,I guess we're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.95,0:18:02.82,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.82,0:18:13.32,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnArial\shad0\b1\frz8.119\fs26\shad1\c&HD9FDFE&\move(284,32,284,71,19,2480)\3c&H958C3B&\4c&H2B6190&}Supermarket Hatsushima
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.92,0:18:18.83,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,Wait. Where did Kinme-san go?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.26,0:18:21.55,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,She was right there a second ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.55,0:18:24.23,Default,Cameraman,0,0,0,,Does she know the last ferry leaves soon?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.23,0:18:26.65,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,I'll go look for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.34,0:18:35.34,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\shad0\fs20\c&H13497B&\3c&H4363A5&\move(502,60,540,60,0,3982)}Inn
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.34,0:18:39.35,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\shad0\fs30\c&H9FB5CF&\3c&H4363A5&\move(307,20,365,20,24,3982)\b1}Inn
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.34,0:18:39.35,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\shad0\fs35\c&H9FB5CF&\3c&H32344A&\move(310,287,365,287,24,3982)\b1}Kiki
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.20,0:19:14.63,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,Where could she have gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.12,0:19:19.39,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,Oh, there she is!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.30,0:19:21.14,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.43,0:19:32.90,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh, Hatsuayu-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.29,0:19:36.65,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,U-Um, the boat is leaving soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.65,0:19:39.12,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,What? Oh, I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.66,0:19:44.68,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,This is my fault. I'm sorry for \Nmaking you run, Hatsuayu-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.16,0:19:46.82,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,It's okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.82,0:19:48.67,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,We will make it, won't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.67,0:19:52.17,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs22\b1\c&H75C0F0&\4c&H002C6E&\3c&H4A88D3&}Welcome to {\fs30}Hatsushima
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.67,0:19:51.24,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,Yes! Let's make sure we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.58,0:19:58.34,Default,Cameraman,0,0,0,,Oh. There they are!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.34,0:19:59.68,Default,Cameraman,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.98,0:20:14.19,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Ugh. I didn't even buy any souvenirs.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.53,0:20:19.01,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I thought we still had plenty of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.46,0:20:32.77,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,Um, Kinme-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.77,0:20:33.58,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.58,0:20:39.23,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,U-Um, have you ever been \Nto Hatsushima before?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.23,0:20:39.97,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.45,0:20:42.88,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,I apologize if I'm mistaken,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.88,0:20:48.48,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,but there were a couple of moments \Nwhen you seemed to be lost in memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.56,0:20:53.23,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Well, I don't actually know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.54,0:20:54.57,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.57,0:21:00.24,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I don't remember anything \Nfrom before two years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.96,0:21:06.49,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I had fun today.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.01,0:21:11.22,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,So did I! I was supposed to be working,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.22,0:21:14.38,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,but I enjoyed myself completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.38,0:21:19.02,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Honestly, you had perfect timing \Nsince this was my day off.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.02,0:21:20.55,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Thanks for inviting me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.55,0:21:23.90,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,You're welcome. But you lost a day off.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.88,0:21:30.63,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I can never figure out \Nhow to spend my days off anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.63,0:21:33.20,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Sometimes I end up doing nothing at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.94,0:21:40.78,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,If you'd like, please feel free \Nto get in touch on days like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.12,0:21:43.34,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Huh? Is that all right with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.34,0:21:48.91,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,Of course it is! I'm full of \Nsuggestions. After all...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.47,0:21:52.61,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,I do work in the tourism division.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.60,0:21:55.84,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Then I'd be happy to!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.16,0:21:58.70,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,I could even join you if you'd like.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.70,0:22:00.87,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,That would make me even happier!
